# surge

--- PowerLeveler_ExtraLevels | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_POWER_LEVELER_EXTRA_LEVELS_DESC
raw  Surge's power surges! Increase Super charge rate by <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.ultiChargeBoostPercent>% for <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Surge's power surges! Increase Super charge rate by 30% for 5 sec.
  card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.ultiChargeBoostPercent  30  -> 30
  card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5

--- PowerLeveler_ExtraLevels | gadget | TID_POWER_LEVELER_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Surge's power surges! Increase Super charge rate by <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.ultiChargeBoostPercent>% for <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec. Power Surge also grants <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.decreaseReloadTimePercent>% Reload Speed.
now  Surge's power surges! Increase Super charge rate by 30% for 5 sec. Power Surge also grants 30% Reload Speed.
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.ultiChargeBoostPercent  30  -> 30
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.decreaseReloadTimePercent  30  -> 30

--- PowerLeveler_ExtraLevels | gadget | TID_POWER_LEVELER_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Power Surge also grants <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.decreaseReloadTimePercent>% Reload Speed.
now  Power Surge also grants 30% Reload Speed.
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.decreaseReloadTimePercent  30  -> 30

--- PowerLeveler_Shield | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_POWER_LEVELER_SHIELD_DESC
raw  Within the next <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds> seconds, Surge consumes <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.shieldPercent>% of the damage of the next incoming hit and uses the energy to reload <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values> ammo.
now  Within the next 2 seconds, Surge consumes 50% of the damage of the next incoming hit and uses the energy to reload <!card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values> ammo.
  card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds  2  -> 2
  card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.shieldPercent  50  -> 50
  card.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values  -  -> 1

--- PowerLeveler_Shield | gadget | TID_POWER_LEVELER_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Within the next <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec, Surge absorbs <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.shieldPercent>% damage of the next hit and uses the energy to reload <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values> ammo. If Surge is hit during Power Shield, Gadget cooldown is decreased <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values>%.
now  Within the next 2 sec, Surge absorbs 50% damage of the next hit and uses the energy to reload <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values> ammo. If Surge is hit during Power Shield, Gadget cooldown is decreased <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values>%.
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.duration.ticksAsSeconds  2  -> 2
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.shieldPercent  50  -> 50
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage.values  -  -> 1
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values  -  -> 50

--- PowerLeveler_Shield | gadget | TID_POWER_LEVELER_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  If Surge is hit during Power Shield, Gadget cooldown is decreased <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values>%.
now  If Surge is hit during Power Shield, Gadget cooldown is decreased <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values>%.
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectAlly.actionsOnCancelOnDamage[1].values  -  -> 50
